  "description": "The ASP.NET Core authentication scheme for Elarion app passwords (ADR-0111): HTTP Basic for calendar apps and a feed token in the feed URL's path, with events to replace the credential check, check the user name, create the principal on every request and observe a success; a 401 Basic challenge and a 403 without one. AddElarionIdentityAppPasswordPrincipals<TUser>() creates the principal through ASP.NET Core Identity. Hand-written, no reflection.",
